/ActualText (They are four histograms with error. Simulation scenarios are: \(A\) sun, \(B\) rain, \(C\) snow, and \(D\) fog. The results show that number of fixations of vehicle distance and lane line are more than navigation guidance and pedestrian in the four simulation scenarios. )
/A 245 0 R
/K 0
/P 7 0 R
/S /Figure
/T ()
/Pg 18 0 R
/Alt (They are four histograms with error. Simulation scenarios are: \(A\) sun, \(B\) rain, \(C\) snow, and \(D\) fog. The results show that number of fixations of vehicle distance and lane line are more than navigation guidance and pedestrian in the four simulation scenarios. )
>>
endobj
34 0 obj
<<
/ActualText (They are four histograms with error. Simulation scenarios are: \(A\) sun, \(B\) rain, \(C\) snow, and \(D\) fog. The results show that mean fixation durations of vehicle distance and lane line are more than navigation guidance and pedestrian in the four simulation scenarios.)
/A 246 0 R
/K 0
/P 7 0 R
/S /Figure
/T ()
/Pg 19 0 R
/Alt (They are four histograms with error. Simulation scenarios are: \(A\) sun, \(B\) rain, \(C\) snow, and \(D\) fog. The results show that mean fixation durations of vehicle distance and lane line are more than navigation guidance and pedestrian in the four simulation scenarios.)
>>
endobj
35 0 obj
<<
/ActualText (It is a bar chart. Diagonal fill represents the condition without FHUD, pure color fill represents the condition with FHUD. The results show that dwell time percentage in zone 2 in the condition with FHUD is higher than that in the condition without FHUD. Dwell time percentage in zone 1, 3, and 5 in the condition with FHUD are lower than that in the condition without FHUD.)
/A 247 0 R
/K 0
/P 7 0 R
/S /Figure
/T ()
/Pg 20 0 R
/Alt (It is a bar chart. Diagonal fill represents the condition without FHUD, pure color fill represents the condition with FHUD. The results show that dwell time percentage in zone 2 in the condition with FHUD is higher than that in the condition without FHUD. Dwell time percentage in zone 1, 3, and 5 in the condition with FHUD are lower than that in the condition without FHUD.)
>>
